WEBVTT

00:03:57.775 --> 00:04:00.695
going against the Western tide
of wholesale lockdown

00:04:00.695 --> 00:04:04.156
and instead mounting
short three-day lockdowns.

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:08.035
Of course there was no shortage
of critics to this approach,

00:04:08.035 --> 00:04:10.329
but the outcome speaks for itself.

00:04:10.746 --> 00:04:14.834
So the mortality rate in Sierra Leone
has been on the low side,

00:04:14.834 --> 00:04:15.876
even in Africa.

00:04:16.294 --> 00:04:20.673
The impact on the non-COVID-related
hospital usage has been half

00:04:20.673 --> 00:04:22.049
that of the global average.

00:04:22.258 --> 00:04:23.551
And finally,

00:04:23.551 --> 00:04:25.553
the World Bank has just revised

00:04:25.553 --> 00:04:29.015
the country’s economic growth
for 2021 upwards.

00:04:29.974 --> 00:04:31.350
This clearly demonstrates